<title>AZERBAIJAN: Azeri Feb industrial output rises 2.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Azeri Feb industrial output rises 2.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BAKU 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Azerbaijan's industial output rose 2.1 percent year-on-year in February, reversing a 16.6 percent fall from the same month a year ago, the State Statistics</p>
<p>Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    AZERI INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT     FEB 97  JAN 97   FEB 96</p>
<p>    month/month pct change	-2.6    -6.0    -22.4</p>
<p>    year/year pct change	  +2.1    -9.5    -16.6</p>
<p>-- Tbilisi Newsroom  +995 32 983 961</p>
</text>
